@startuml portal_boundary
!theme cyborg
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
title PORTAL page and controller boundary
actor "Operator / browser" as Browser
participant "L1_PORTAL\nHTTP + page" as Portal
participant "L2_COMMUNICATION\nSetup workflow" as Communication
participant "L1_WIFI\nRadio operations" as Wifi
database "L1_STORAGE" as Storage
Communication -> Wifi : open setup hotspot
Communication -> Portal : start; publish completed network list
Browser -> Portal : load page; request current status
Portal --> Browser : page / published status snapshot
Browser -> Portal : submit setup command
Portal -> Portal : validate fields/state and form ownership
Portal --> Browser : accepted or rejected
Communication -> Portal : read typed queued request
Portal --> Communication : Connect / Rescan / Cancel / Activity
Communication -> Wifi : requested radio operation
opt selected network has an address
 Communication -> Storage : save accepted credentials
end
Communication -> Portal : publish status, cause, list, address
Browser -> Portal : request current status
Portal --> Browser : updated snapshot
Communication -> Portal : publish closing; stop server
note over Portal, Communication
 PORTAL never associates, retries or saves credentials.
 COMMUNICATION owns workflow; CONTROL owns listening priority.
end note
@enduml
